    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Screen Talk: Danny Boyle"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The director of Ink joins us for this Screen Talk, to discuss a career that has placed him among the most successful British filmmakers."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/all-about-the-money-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "All About the Money"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The heir of one of America’s wealthiest families, who has ambitions to rebel against values he now despises, is the subject of Sinéad O’Shea’s compelling documentary portrait."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/tender-loving-care-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Tender Loving Care"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "In a world that feels increasingly untethered from human connection, the incomparable Mike Leigh returns with a thought-provoking and compassionate view of urban life."
    }
  ]
